Subject: Test each deadline recheck of the private GPU report take
Why: AC-T7.4.1: take() rechecks the original deadline after its frame read and after parsing (0019/0020), and neither branch had a direct test. A test-only clock makes one recheck see the deadline pass; production still reads the monotonic clock.

